Quadcuber A1 boundary analysis: regen_C1_I6.452_T0.1_BV14.7
* Original simplified model; NOT a manufacturer macro-model.
* VM precharged to 9V. Supply disconnected; no other loads (conservative for charge).
* Constant injected BUS current is a test parameter, not a motor current prediction.
Cbulk vm 0 0.00282 ic=9
Rleak vm 0 1e9
Vregen regen vm 0
Iregen 0 regen PWL(0 0 1m 0 1.001m 6.452 0.101 6.452 0.101001 0)
BTVS vm 0 I=max((v(vm)-14.7)/0.172185,0)
.ic v(vm)=9
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-9 vntol=1e-7 method=gear
.control
set wr_vecnames
set wr_singlescale
save all @btvs[i]
tran 2e-05 0.105 0 2e-05
wrdata waveform.txt v(vm) @btvs[i] i(Vregen)
quit
.endc
.end
